unces 100+ new roles across the region\" href=\"/news/head-of-EMEA-new-roles\"><circle cx=\"183.75375632623647\" cy=\"69.56434985677369\" r=\"16.733126291998992\" fill=\"transparent\" class=\"_74-EFW_nodeHit\"></circle></a><a aria-label=\"Jay Kreps appointed to Anthropic's Board of Directors\" href=\"/news/jay-kreps-appointed-to-board-of-directors\"><circle cx=\"171.4201407140868\" cy=\"34.186362228593445\" r=\"16.733126291998992\" fill=\"transparent\" class=\"_74-EFW_nodeHit\"></circle></a><a aria-label=\"Mike Krieger joins Anthropic as Chief Product Officer\" href=\"/news/mike-krieger-joins-anthropic\"><circle cx=\"252.86688\" cy=\"38.62413357263547\" r=\"16.733126291998992\" fill=\"transparent\" class=\"_74-EFW_nodeHit\"></circle></a></svg></div></div><div class=\"tOQyXa_headline-6 yApI1G_headline\" data-component=\"Headline\">Related articles</div><ul class=\"yApI1G_list\"><li><div class=\"yApI1G_card _8J1zJG_card\"><header class=\"_8J1zJG_cardHeader\"><div class=\"_8J1zJG_eyebrowsWrapper\"><p>Announcements</p><p>Oct 23, 2025</p></div></header><div class=\"_8J1zJG_text\" data-lines=\"3\" style=\"--text-lines:3\"><a class=\"_8J1zJG_link\" href=\"/news/expanding-our-use-of-google-cloud-tpus-and-services\">Expanding our use of Google Cloud TPUs and Services</a></div></div></li></ul><a data-component=\"AnchorButton\" data-variant=\"tertiary\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-tertiary f9ZZrG_size-small f9ZZrG_icon-format-trailing yApI1G_cta\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=leadership\">View more<span class=\"f9ZZrG_icon\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.1465 4.64648C11.3417 4.45127 11.6582 4.45136 11.8535 4.64648L16.8535 9.64649L16.916 9.72267C16.9703 9.80418 17 9.90061 17 10C17 10.1326 16.9473 10.2598 16.8535 10.3535L11.8535 15.3535C11.6583 15.5486 11.3417 15.5487 11.1465 15.3535C10.9513 15.1583 10.9514 14.8418 11.1465 14.6465L15.293 10.5H3.5C3.2239 10.5 3.00006 10.2761 3 10C3 9.72387 3.22386 9.50001 3.5 9.50001H15.293L11.1465 5.35352C10.9514 5.15826 10.9513 4.8417 11.1465 4.64648Z\"></path></svg></span></a></div></aside></div><div class=\"PA4F1q_body\" data-article-body=\"true\" data-theme=\"ivory\"><p class=\"PA4F1q_reading-column post-text\">We're excited to announce that Rahul Patil has joined Anthropic as our Chief Technology Officer. Rahul will oversee our engineering organization across product, compute, infrastructure, inference, data science, and security as we scale Claude to meet growing enterprise demand worldwide.</p><p class=\"PA4F1q_reading-column post-text\">Rahul brings over 20 years of experience building and maintaining industry-leading infrastructure for businesses. Most recently, he served as CTO of Stripe, where he guided the technical organization supporting millions of businesses processing more than trillion dollars annually. Prior to Stripe, Rahul held senior engineering leadership roles at AWS, Microsoft, and Oracle Cloud Infrastructure, developing deep expertise in building reliable, scalable mission-critical systems that businesses depend on.</p><p class=\"PA4F1q_reading-column post-text\">“I'm thrilled to join Anthropic at this pivotal moment in AI development,” said Rahul. “Anthropic’s brilliance in both research and products, and their conscientious approach to pushing the boundaries of what's possible feels like the most important work I could be doing right now—I personally can't think of a greater calling and responsibility.”</p><p class=\"PA4F1q_reading-column post-text\">“Building AI systems that people can trust has been central to our work as we've grown to serve over 300,000 business customers,” said Daniela Amodei, co-founder and President of Anthropic. “Rahul brings a proven track record in building and scaling robust infrastructure that businesses can depend on as we work to make Claude the leading intelligence platform for enterprises.”</p><p class=\"PA4F1q_reading-column post-text\">For developers building with Claude, Rahul's appointment signals our commitment to world-class infrastructure and reliability at scale. As part of these changes, Sam McCandlish, one of Anthropic's co-founders and previously CTO, has taken on a new role as Chief Architect. In this role, Sam will deepen his focus on large-scale model training, continuing to lead pretraining while expanding his scope to include research productivity and RL infrastructure.</p></div></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$-->","canvases":0}